<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ryder System cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ryder System cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it downgraded Ryder System Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- said 1997 earnings estimates of $2.10 a share and 1998 estimate of $2.60 a share remain unchanged.</p>
<p>-- said Ryder told analysts in a recent meeting its internal goal is to hit $3.00 a share or better in 1998. Salomon said it believes the $3.00 a share target is aggressive.</p>
<p>-- Ryder lost 2 to 30-5/8.</p>
</text>
